<title>FRANCE: Details of new monthly EU malt export refunds.</title>
<headline>Details of new monthly EU malt export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union cut the refunds applying to daily roasted and unroasted barley malt exports but raised the refund applying to wheat malt exports, with effect from February 21, grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU took the decision at a weekly meeting of its grain panel on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new rates are as follows (in Ecus per tonne).</p>
<p>				  February 21	 January 10</p>
<p>    Wheat malt		   20.00		 17.00</p>
<p>    Unroasted barley malt    35.75		 37.70</p>
<p>    Roasted barley malt	41.80		 44.00</p>
</text>
